invalid type: string "Company Overview: Hyder Electric Bikes is a Pakistani electric two-wheeler company headquartered in Lahore, Punjab. Founded in 2021, Hyder designs and assembles electric bikes locally with a focus on affordable last-mile mobility for students, commuters, and small delivery businesses. Hyder currently manufactures three models: the ELI 100, the HLI 100, and the SLI 100.", expe